WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.170
NARRATOR: Marcus is a
thirty-four-year-old veteran

2
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.500
who has bravely served our country.

3
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.880
Today, he walks into community
services seeking emergency housing.

4
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.820
MARCUS: I just need a place to stay.

5
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.540
That's all I'm here for.

6
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.460
(sighs) Look, I'm going
to be straight with you.

7
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.160
I've been using. Heroin, mostly.

8
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.100
Started with pills after
I got hurt overseas.

9
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.720
Things got out of hand.
I know how that sounds.

10
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.320
I've thought about getting help. I have.

11
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.200
But the last time I went to the VA,

12
00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.760
they made me feel like I
was wasting their time.

13
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.560
Like I was the problem.

14
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.800
I'm not going back there.

15
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.600
I'm not saying I'm ready
for any program or whatever.

16
00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.340
I just need somewhere to sleep tonight.

17
00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.940
Can you help with that or not?

18
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.420
NARRATOR: You have now
heard Marcus's story.

19
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.140
How do you respond?
